  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/fish/tetra.py): a neon tetra, 3.5 cm -- tiny and slim, a short blunt head with a HUGE eye (its iris glinting blue); the electric BLUE-GREEN STRIPE from the eye back to the adipose fin, the brilliant RED band under its rear half to the tail, a silvery-white belly in front (painted); clear, faint fins: the dorsal mid-back, the little ADIPOSE fin, a long anal, small pelvics, a forked tail. Each fin is one membrane sheet. A schooling SWIMMER (the fish's plumbing; an aquarium fish).",
